# What python-starter exports to projects that graft it (https://github.com/danielnaab/graft/tree/v2):
# the pattern docs generated projects link to, the template sources those docs cite as evidence,
# and CHANGELOG.md.
# The rest (READMEs, scripts, CI, the template's own agent docs and KB config) is the template's own.
*                     export-ignore
/docs                 -export-ignore
/docs/architecture    -export-ignore
/docs/architecture/** -export-ignore
/docs/decisions       -export-ignore
/docs/decisions/**    -export-ignore
/docs/guides          -export-ignore
/docs/guides/**       -export-ignore
/docs/reference       -export-ignore
/docs/reference/**    -export-ignore
/src                  -export-ignore
/src/**               -export-ignore
/tests                -export-ignore
/tests/**             -export-ignore
/copier.yml           -export-ignore
/pyproject.toml.jinja -export-ignore
/CHANGELOG.md         -export-ignore
